      detail: `Checklist: prv-groups.json passes Test-PaPrvGroupConfig with no Finding, and every entry has an end date and a ticket. Every PRV group that holds an Entra role is role-assignable, and no PRV group is dynamic or synchronized. No group and no eligible service principal is a member or owner of a PRV group, and no T0 group has an owner. Member and owner policies match prv-group-policy.json: approval by the tier's approver group for T0 and T1, activation no longer than 8 hours, expiration required. Each approver group has at least two members, and none of them is approving their own group. The latest plan was reviewed by someone other than its author before -Apply, and a rerun shows no changes. The reader app holds exactly the four read permissions; the writer holds those and only the write permissions the plan lists. The pinned pages match their manifest, and every upstream commit since the pin has been reviewed. Next: Chapter 06 — PIM for Azure Resources.`,
